d it at the high-souled Rāghava.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.954,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-79-29"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6066030","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"8cd630c6c3572c33a1aaadb91a2b4dd295933f3f7e005f803de0ef0acf8da5c5","compact":"b5f4eed95afc23f5861500b594fc4eeadf8929c901c414c52ef453a8a27daf57","nasal":"e5b1c9dbcac7b4f78e27df26f44c28241ac52115ef1bf647e4ac1bbd0c65b8c0"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-66-31","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":66,"verse":31,"english":"Rāghava, with four shafts, sundered that dart, in the sky, flaming and hurled at him by the son of Khara.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.766,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-79-30"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6066031","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"b5d4202c4e2448f2fec92d427b0fab795559fbb01a199902345ded624d08abed","compact":"013fb3036458e7024115a68b036675ed46c77cbf57ffd199a82fcb7d52855736","nasal":"49c0ebe608203450a9b7d3e1071ec6d3f79f9cd3e515cfb8330ddb94dc67d69d"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-66-32","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":66,"verse":32,"english":"That flaming dart, feathered in gold, being splintered into several pieces by Rāma's arrows fell down on earth like a huge fire-brand.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.623,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-79-31"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6066032","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"f28f86dc2dd61f5f8c0394fb6a8e4d9f8f3863157edce2d3cc491628b93533c7","compact":"e8b053f0ea07fa92cdc43b4a4639cf714962fbcd8b80716a25c40bdf7d7909b6","nasal":"8fd50081e1de5a0779f0ef12d6d1677a62210270b6ffda7c7afb9bda356784d6"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-66-33","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":66,"verse":33,"english":"Beholding tha